            "review_title": "Review at Com Chay Loving Hut Hoang Kim",
            "review_text": "Thanh Thủy\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nGreat destination if you want to find vegetarian dishes\nMay 2020\nFirst, the restaurant has a location that is quite easy to find, right on the big road so there is no need for a roundabout time. Next, the restaurant space is very airy, clean and bright. The food is delicious, varied, and cooked hot. The staff is also very enthusiastic. The restaurant is suitable to go alone, or with friends, and family.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 22, 2020",
