            "review_text": "u07\nUnited States173 contributions\n0\nBest plant-based noodles in Hanoi\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nHands down the best plant-based/vegan beef noodles I’ve ever had. The restaurant looks like any local restaurant in Hanoi, but the food quality definitely surpasses its look. We all loved the food we had there. All the foods are plant-based/vegan friendly. I highly recommend this place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 10, 2019",
